      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HIGHGATE FRANKY (5) broke from a low draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only a long neck (19.63) behind GHOST WALKER at this track. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and four minor placings to his credit. Capable of going well again. GHOST WALKER (4) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by a long neck at this track in a handy 19.60 beating HIGHGATE FRANKY. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Sure to be thereabouts. KALE ROCKS (2) was below best at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth at Warragul, but was among the placings at this track three back. Expected to bounce back to best. CAN'T TURN LEFT (1) placed last start and is in the mix again.",
